Files to change for BGC;

Config.yaml
 
Add in a single obgc_obc files rather than 1.
Add in the dust file 
Using an executable with BGC
 
Diag Table 
Add in whichever BGC fields you want 
 
MOM input
Check that the default is to turn reentrant x and y off. 
 
 
